OL,3,GNEWSAAurigny 'prioritises' lifeline
OL,4,Aroute to island
OL,5,
OL,6,FAurigny has announced it will be
OL,7,Fprioritising the Guernsey to Alderney
OL,8,Froute for Alderney residents after only
OL,9,F85% of flights on the route were
OL,10,Fcompleted as scheduled from January to
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,13,FThe airline said it would reduce
OL,14,FAlderney to Southampton flights in
OL,15,Forder to prioritise the "lifeline
OL,16,Froute" between Alderney and Guernsey in
OL,17,FDecember and January.
OL,19,FThe changes follow what the airline
OL,20,Fcalled "a period of unacceptable levels
OL,21,Fof disruption".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
