OL,3,GNEWSAAurigny 'prioritises' lifeline
OL,4,Aroute to island
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it would run four return
OL,7,Fflights a day on the Alderney-Guernsey
OL,8,Froute and would run one direct
OL,9,FAlderney-Southampton return flight on
OL,10,FMondays and Fridays.
